1998 ought to be a pretty good year for g77 and egcs on Linux/Alpha,
but I'm not under the impression that Digital Fortran is going to
be seriously threatened in that timeframe, at least.  Just hoping
that g77 won't be as embarrassing on Alphas (at least to me) by the
end of this year.
