Not quite that simple.  Alphas have a bit more complicated bios/boot
sequence.  I would recommend working with one unit using Debian as
your test bed and develop your install scripts using dpkg command.
Then you should be OK.  Will the units come preformatted?  If not,
some initial manual configuration of each machine may be required.



