Laszlo Udvardi a �crit dans le message
<35225891.7AD1F651@newton.phy.bme.hu>...
>We would like to buy few 21164 (533MHz) based PC-s.
>Which motherboard would be the best ?


Ok, you have two type of 21164:
    - 21164A includes a L2 cache memory which works on LX-motherboard
    - 21164PC doesn't include L2 cache memory but includes MVI-instructions
which are specialized in compression and decompression for standard format.
this one works on SX-motherboard.

In terms of SPEC, the 21164A is the best. But if you only need audio-video
applications, 21164PC is fine and much cheaper than 21164A.

I hope that will help you in your choice. Good bye

