>>>>> "MK" == Michael Korpics <korpics@expertchoice.com> writes:

    MK> Has anyone compiled Qualcomm's qpopper 2.4 for rh5 alpha?  I
    MK> get a conflicting type error with stdio.h for sys_errlist.
    MK> Some help or a patch would be super.

Hey Mike,

I've gotten the same error when building glimpse 4.0.  The fix is
pretty simple.  The correct prototype for sys_errlist is "extern const
char *const sys_errlist[]" (according to stdio.h), so you need to find
the declaration for sys_errlist in the qpopper source code and fix
their declaration.  You'll probably have to add both "const"s to the
decl.  You also might be able to get away with commenting the
declaration out and #including <stdio.h> instead.

HTH.

